## Before (Denormalized/Messy Data)

```json
[
  {
    "event_info": "User john.doe attended conference 2026-10-05 at NYC office. Contact: john@example.com, Phone: 555-1234",
    "details": "John Doe | Conference | 2026-10-05 | Room 101 | NYC | john@example.com"
